      <MissionDesc>NOVACOMM'S MISSION IS TO CREATE JOBS AND EDUCATE SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA'S HIGH-TECH COMMUNITY AT LARGE, PRIMARILY THROUGH THE EVONEXUS INCUBATOR.</MissionDesc>
      <SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>0</SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>
      <SignificantChangeInd>0</SignificantChangeInd>
      <Desc>EVONEXUS IS A LEADING NON-PROFIT HIGH-TECH TRADE ORGANIZATION AND INCUBATOR WITH LOCATIONS IN SAN DIEGO, IRVINE AND SAN MATEO. OUR MISSION IS TO STIMULATE THE GROWTH OF NEW HIGH TECHNOLOGY COMPANIES IN OUR REGION. WE PROVIDE FULL SERVICES - FURNISHED OFFICE SPACE, DOMAIN EXPERTS AND MENTORS, AND THE OPPORTUNITY TO LEVERAGE OUR WIDE NETWORK OF BUSINESS AND VC CONTRACTS - TO START-UP COMPANIES STRIVING TO ACHIEVE SUSTAINABILITY. ADMITTED STARTUPS WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE PROGRAM UP TO 24 MONTHS.EVONEXUS' STATISTICS TO DATE:- ESTABLISHED OCTOBER 2009- 7,000+ APPLICATIONS RECEIVED, 267 COMPANIES IN OUR PORTFOLIO- $4.2B IN TOTAL FUNDING AND ACQUISITION OUTCOME BY COMPANIES. 85% OF COMPANIES RECEIVED FUNDING DURING INCUBATION. - 82% OF PORTFOLIO COMPANIES ARE STILL ACTIVE- 12 COMPANIES CURRENTLY INCUBATING- 54 ACQUISITIONS- 4,000+ JOBS CREATED</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <Desc>MARKETLINK IS AN OPPORTUNITY FOR COMPANIES TO INITIATE AND DEVELOP STRATEGIC RELATIONSHIPS WITH LEADING MULTI-NATIONAL CORPORATIONS. THIS UNIQUE AND POWERFUL PROGRAM INTRODUCES PARTICIPATING COMPANIES TO TOP-LEVEL EXECUTIVES SEARCHING FOR NEW PRODUCTS AND TECHNOLOGIES, ALL AT NO COST TO THE APPLICANT. THE PROGRAM IS A HIGHLY EFFICIENT AND EFFECTIVE VEHICLE FOR CONNECTING INDUSTRY GIANTS WITH QUALITY COMPANIES DEVELOPING THE LATEST TECHNOLOGY AND PRODUCTS.MARKETLINK HAS CONNECTED INNOVATIVE COMPANIES WITH MULTI-NATIONAL CORPORATIONS SUCH AS VIASAT, CUBIC, HP, LG AND OTHERS IN A TARGETED AND EXTREMELY TIME-EFFICIENT MANNER.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
